Y AND COIN OUTSTANDING AND IN CIRCULATION</b></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Introduction\\u2014U.S. Currency and Coin Outstanding and in Circulation</td><td>62</td></tr><tr><td>USCC-1\\u2014Amounts Outstanding and in Circulation; Currency, Coins</td><td>62</td></tr><tr><td>USCC-2\\u2014Amounts Outstanding and in Circulation; by Denomination, Per Capita Comparative Totals</td><td>63</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [146, 1789, 619, 1824], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": \"INTERNATIONAL STATISTICS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [146, 1857, 576, 1898], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": \"FOREIGN CURRENCY POSITIONS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1337, 1989, 1495, 2018], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": \"December 2020\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [135, 80, 178, 130], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"IV\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [566, 184, 1064, 264], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"Table of Contents\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [133, 285, 1461, 1697], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Introduction\\u2014Foreign Currency Positions</td><td>67</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"2\\\">SECTION I\\u2014Canadian Dollar Positions</td></tr><tr><td>FCP-I-1\\u2014Weekly Report of Major Market Participants</td><td>68</td></tr><tr><td>FCP-I-2\\u2014Monthly Report of Major Market Participants</td><td>69</td></tr><tr><td>FCP-I-3\\u2014Quarterly Report of Large Market Participants</td><td>69</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"2\\\">SECTION II\\u2014Japanese Yen Positions</td></tr><tr><td>FCP-II-1\\u2014Weekly Report of Major Market Participants</td><td>70</td></tr><tr><td>FCP-II-2\\u2014Monthly Report of Major Market Parti