"coord\": [862, 1919, 1213, 1940], \"page_id\": 1}], \"content\": \"Bureau of the Fiscal Service\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [224, 780, 1406, 929], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"The Treasury Bulletin is issued quarterly in March, June, September, and December by the Bureau of the Fiscal Service, Cash Accounting and Reporting Division. Statistical data is compiled from sources within Treasury departmental offices and bureaus, as well as various other Federal program agencies.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [455, 966, 1175, 999], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"The publication staff can be reached by electronic mail.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [519, 1032, 1098, 1077], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"treasury.bulletin@fiscal.treasury.gov\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [244, 1117, 1373, 1188], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"Internet service subscribers can access the Treasury Bulletin in Microsoft Word or PDF format through the Bureau of the Fiscal Service's home page.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [625, 1223, 984, 1268], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"www.fiscal.treasury.gov\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [565, 191, 1067, 259], \"page_id\": 3}], \"content\": \"Table of Contents\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [144, 321, 545, 356], \"page_id\": 3}], \"content\": \"FINANCIAL OPERATIONS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 387, 1454, 453], \"page_id\": 3}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td><b>PROFILE OF THE ECONOMY</b></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Analysis\\u2014Summary of Economic Indicators</td><td>1</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": nu