 files to understand structure\n- [x] Find Department of Commerce on-budget and off-budget outlays for FY 2016-2024\n- [ ] Calculate Quartile 1 using Tukey exclusive median method\n- [ ] Round to nearest hundredths and write to answer.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"todo"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
